1f:["$","figure",null,{"className":"page-visual page-visual--inline","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/images/application-writing-1280.webp","srcSet":"/images/application-writing-640.webp 640w, /images/application-writing-1280.webp 1280w","sizes":"(max-width: 860px) calc(100vw - 32px), 440px","width":1280,"height":853,"alt":"Illustrative student writing application notes beside a laptop","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"children":"Illustrative editorial image; not a photograph identifying a particular university."}]]}]
20:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[null,["$","section","1-Admission requirements and the last published intake",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Admission requirements and the last published intake"}],[["$","p","The reviewed undergraduate page lists a minimum SAT reasoning result of 1,000/1,600 and an IB diploma minimum of 28/45 with a relevant Higher Level subject. It also provides A-level and national qualification routes. These are application minima, not expected admission outcomes.",{"children":"The reviewed undergraduate page lists a minimum SAT reasoning result of 1,000/1,600 and an IB diploma minimum of 28/45 with a relevant Higher Level subject. It also provides A-level and national qualification routes. These are application minima, not expected admission outcomes."}],["$","p","The same page states that predicted results are not evaluated and that originals are required after admission. Its 2026/27 fall application window was 2 February–12 July 2026 and has passed. A future intake needs its own current notice.",{"children":"The same page states that predicted results are not evaluated and that originals are required after admission. Its 2026/27 fall application window was 2 February–12 July 2026 and has passed. A future intake needs its own current notice."}],["$","p","Build a personal qualification map: final result available, accepted route, subject match and original-document availability. If you are awaiting final results, ask about the next eligible intake rather than assuming a predicted-grade practice from another university applies here.",{"children":"Build a personal qualification map: final result available, accepted route, subject match and original-document availability. If you are awaiting final results, ask about the next eligible intake rather than assuming a predicted-grade practice from another university applies here."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://w3.bilkent.edu.tr/international/how-to-apply/",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://w3.bilkent.edu.tr/international/how-to-apply/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Bilkent undergraduate application and qualification list"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","2-Tuition waivers and accommodation awards",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Tuition waivers and accommodation awards"}],[["$","p","The international scholarship policy lists five tuition-waiver levels in 20-percentage-point steps. Limited accommodation awards may be available to top students with full tuition support. A full tuition award alone should therefore not be budgeted as free accommodation.",{"children":"The international scholarship policy lists five tuition-waiver levels in 20-percentage-point steps. Limited accommodation awards may be available to top students with full tuition support. A full tuition award alone should therefore not be budgeted as free accommodation."}],["$","p","Ask for each covered cost in the offer. If your room award is pending, keep the housing line active until a written decision confirms the type and duration. A provisional aid request is not an award.",{"children":"Ask for each covered cost in the offer. If your room award is pending, keep the housing line active until a written decision confirms the type and duration. A provisional aid request is not an award."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$L24","$undefined"]}],"$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28"]}]
