25:["$","section","3-2026-entry tuition and a worked net bill",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"2026-entry tuition and a worked net bill"}],[["$","p","The 2026/27 international fee schedule lists USD 18,400 annually, including 10% VAT, for students admitted in 2026. It has different rows for earlier cohorts and provides for two equal instalments.",{"children":"The 2026/27 international fee schedule lists USD 18,400 annually, including 10% VAT, for students admitted in 2026. It has different rows for earlier cohorts and provides for two equal instalments."}],["$","p","Worked example: applying a confirmed 60% tuition waiver to USD 18,400 would leave USD 7,360 annually. Dividing that remaining amount into two equal parts gives USD 3,680 before any other charge, subject to the actual invoice and award terms. This is arithmetic, not a prediction that an applicant will receive that award.",{"children":"Worked example: applying a confirmed 60% tuition waiver to USD 18,400 would leave USD 7,360 annually. Dividing that remaining amount into two equal parts gives USD 3,680 before any other charge, subject to the actual invoice and award terms. This is arithmetic, not a prediction that an applicant will receive that award."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://w3.bilkent.edu.tr/en/international-and-other-students-tuition-fees/",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://w3.bilkent.edu.tr/en/international-and-other-students-tuition-fees/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Bilkent international fees by entry cohort"}]]}]]]}],["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for 2026-entry tuition and a worked net bill","children":[["$","$L4","/guides/turkey-university-tuition-fees/",{"href":"/guides/turkey-university-tuition-fees/","children":["Tuition units and comparison method",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
26:["$","section","4-Retention conditions: a scholarship has an academic budget too",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Retention conditions: a scholarship has an academic budget too"}],[["$","p","The published international policy requires the relevant minimum curriculum course load and an Annual-GPA of at least 2.00/4.00 for tuition support. Accommodation scholarship holders face a 2.50 Annual-GPA threshold. The policy also addresses attendance and reductions when requirements are not met.",{"children":"The published international policy requires the relevant minimum curriculum course load and an Annual-GPA of at least 2.00/4.00 for tuition support. Accommodation scholarship holders face a 2.50 Annual-GPA threshold. The policy also addresses attendance and reductions when requirements are not met."}],["$","p","Read the definition of Annual-GPA and permitted withdrawals in the original policy. Do not substitute your cumulative GPA for an annual calculation or assume an optional extra module satisfies the minimum curriculum load.",{"children":"Read the definition of Annual-GPA and permitted withdrawals in the original policy. Do not substitute your cumulative GPA for an annual calculation or assume an optional extra module satisfies the minimum curriculum load."}],["$","p","Original planning case: a student considers dropping a compulsory module to protect their average. They first check the scholarship course-load rule with the department and financial-aid office. A higher average does not necessarily preserve funding if the required load is no longer met.",{"children":"Original planning case: a student considers dropping a compulsory module to protect their average. They first check the scholarship course-load rule with the department and financial-aid office. A higher average does not necessarily preserve funding if the required load is no longer met."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://w3.bilkent.edu.tr/international/scholarships-for-international-students/",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://w3.bilkent.edu.tr/international/scholarships-for-international-students/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Bilkent scholarship continuation and reduction rules"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}]
27:["$","section","5-Incoming aid and later merit are different routes",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Incoming aid and later merit are different routes"}],[["$","p","Bilkent also publishes a continuing-student merit route involving annual performance and rank among non-scholarship students. It should not be entered as guaranteed funding for a new applicant.",{"children":"Bilkent also publishes a continuing-student merit route involving annual performance and rank among non-scholarship students. It should not be entered as guaranteed funding for a new applicant."}],["$","p","If the admission award does not make the first year affordable, a hoped-for future merit award is not a secure solution. Build the first-year plan from confirmed resources. Keep any later improvement as a separate upside scenario, together with its exact academic conditions.",{"children":"If the admission award does not make the first year affordable, a hoped-for future merit award is not a secure solution. Build the first-year plan from confirmed resources. Keep any later improvement as a separate upside scenario, together with its exact academic conditions."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Incoming aid and later merit are different routes","children":[["$","$L4","/guides/cost-of-living-in-turkey-for-students/",{"href":"/guides/cost-of-living-in-turkey-for-students/","children":["Ankara living-cost inputs",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/guides/student-accommodation-turkey/",{"href":"/guides/student-accommodation-turkey/","children":["University and KYK accommodation routes",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
28:["$","section","6-A Bilkent offer is ready to compare when…",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-7","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"A Bilkent offer is ready to compare when…"}],[["$","p","For research degrees, start again with the relevant graduate department: this page’s numeric tuition and incoming-aid examples concern the international undergraduate route. Do not reuse a historical research-centre scholarship article as a university-wide graduate promise.",{"children":"For research degrees, start again with the relevant graduate department: this page’s numeric tuition and incoming-aid examples concern the international undergraduate route. Do not reuse a historical research-centre scholarship article as a university-wide graduate promise."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","$L29",null,{"id":"guides/bilkent-university-admissions-scholarships:section-7","title":"Check your progress","items":["My application uses accepted final results for the correct programme.","I requested financial assistance and have the actual award decision.","I know the fee cohort, net annual tuition and instalments.","I have checked Annual-GPA, load, attendance and room-award conditions.","I can cover housing and arrival costs that the offer does not cover."]}],"$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for A Bilkent offer is ready to compare when…","children":[["$","$L4","/guides/sabanci-university-admissions-scholarships/",{"href":"/guides/sabanci-university-admissions-scholarships/","children":["Sabancı: compare undergraduate and graduate funding",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/guides/metu-international-admissions/",{"href":"/guides/metu-international-admissions/","children":["METU Ankara: public-university alternative",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
